  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 400°F.",
    "Rinse quinoa and cook with water or broth in a saucepan, stirring occasionally.",
    "In a large skillet, sauté onion and garlic in olive oil until soft.",
    "Add chickpeas, peas, parsley, lemon juice, salt, and pepper to the skillet. Toss well.",
    "Combine cooked quinoa with quinoa mixture in an oven-safe dish.",
    "Sprinkle 1/4 cup of buckwheat evenly over the top.",
    "Bake for 25 minutes or until golden brown on top and heated through.",
    "Serve hot as a side dish or main course."
